<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface">
  <title>Git Staging View</title>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <indexterm>Git Client add-on<indexterm>Git Staging view</indexterm></indexterm>
      </keywords>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
  <body>
    <p id="p_pbt_wn5_nsb">The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view is the main interface
      for reviewing changes, staging files, writing commit messages, committing, pushing, and
      pulling. You can open it in any of the following ways:</p>
    <ul id="ul_git_staging_view_access">
      <li id="li_git_staging_view_access_window">Go to <menucascade>
          <uicontrol>Window</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Show View</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol>
        </menucascade>.</li>
      <li id="li_git_staging_view_access_tools">Go to <menucascade>
          <uicontrol>Tools</uicontrol>
          <uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol>
        </menucascade>.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      <fig id="fig_tlr_p45_nsb">
        <title>Git Staging View</title>
        <image href="../img/git-staging-view.png" placement="inline" id="image_m3r_f5k_gjc"/>
      </fig>
    </p>
    <section id="section_git_staging_view_layout">
      <title>Main Areas</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_view_layout_intro">The <uicontrol>Git Staging</uicontrol> view is
        organized around the following areas:</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_git_staging_view_main_areas">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_toolbar">
            <dt><uicontrol>Toolbar</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Contains repository-level actions, such as push, pull, stash, history, branch
              manager, and the <uicontrol>Ellipsis</uicontrol> menu.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_unstaged_area">
            <dt><uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lists changed files that are not yet part of the next commit.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_stage_controls">
            <dt><uicontrol>Stage</uicontrol> and <uicontrol>Unstage</uicontrol> controls</dt>
            <dd>Move files between the unstaged and staged areas and switch the file list between
              tree view and list view.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_staged_area">
            <dt><uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lists files that are ready to be committed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_commit_area">
            <dt><uicontrol>Commit message</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lets you write the commit message, reuse a previous message, generate a message with
              AI, enable automatic push after commit, or amend the last commit.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_view_toolbar">
      <title>Toolbar</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_toolbar_intro">The toolbar contains the main repository-level actions.
        Most of these actions are also available in the top-level <uicontrol>Git</uicontrol>
        menu.</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_git_staging_toolbar_actions">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ll5_v45_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousReference16.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_cbp_g5k_gjc"/>Push</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pushes your local repository changes to the remote repository. The arrow icon has a
              small plus sign in the bottom-right corner when there are changes that have not yet
              been pushed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ik5_1p5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/NextReference16.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_dbp_g5k_gjc"/>Pull</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pulls changes from the remote repository into your local repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_lyq_dp5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Stash18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_ebp_g5k_gjc"/>Stash</uicontrol> drop-down menu</dt>
            <dd>Lets you create a stash from the changed files in the working copy or open the list
              of existing stashes so you can apply or remove one.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_mbg_rp5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/History18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_fbp_g5k_gjc"/>Show current repository history</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref
                href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history"
                  ><uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view</xref> at the bottom of the
              application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_fv4_mq5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Branch18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_gbp_g5k_gjc"/>Show Git Branch Manager view</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref
                href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"><uicontrol>Git
                  Branch Manager</uicontrol> view</xref> on the right side of the application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_ellipsis_toolbar">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_hbp_g5k_gjc"/>Ellipsis</uicontrol> menu</dt>
            <dd>Opens a menu with more repository actions, setup actions, preferences, and
              credential actions.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_file_areas">
      <title>File Areas and Stage Controls</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_file_areas_intro">Use the file areas to decide which changed files belong
        in the next commit.</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_git_staging_file_areas">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_rcg_nr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lists changed files that are not yet staged. Review these files before you decide
              what to include in the next commit.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_tmw_vr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area</dt>
            <dd>Lists files that are ready to be committed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
      <p id="p_git_staging_stage_controls_intro">The controls between the two file areas include the
        following actions:</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_gng_s3j_43c">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_jyd_tr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/StageSelected18.png" id="image_vbv_n3j_43c"
                  placement="inline"/>Stage selected</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Moves the selected unstaged files to the <uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol>
              area.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_rvy_tr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/StageAll18.png" id="image_wbv_n3j_43c"
                  placement="inline"/>Stage all</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Moves all unstaged files to the <uicontrol>Staged files</uicontrol> area.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_wmw_vr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/UnstageSelected18.png" id="image_brz_43j_43c"
                  placement="inline"/>Unstage selected</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Moves the selected staged files to the <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol>
              area.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_xmw_vr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/UnstageAll18.png" id="image_crz_43j_43c"
                  placement="inline"/>Unstage all</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Moves all staged files to the <uicontrol>Unstaged files</uicontrol> area.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_eh5_5r5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Tree18.png" id="image_xbv_n3j_43c" placement="inline"
                />Switch to tree view</uicontrol> / <uicontrol><image href="../img/Flat18.png"
                  id="image_p2p_hjj_43c" placement="inline"/>Switch to list view</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Switches the file areas between a tree view and a flat list view.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_commit_area">
      <title>Commit Message Area</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_commit_area_intro">Use the <uicontrol>Commit message</uicontrol> area to
        write the message for the staged changes. The following actions are available in the top-right
        corner of the box:</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_nyj_yr5_nsb">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_tr4_jbs_fdc">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/AI-Git16.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_qsg_35k_gjc"/>Generate commit message using AI</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Uses <xref format="html"
                href="https://www.oxygenxml.com/doc/ug-positron-desktop/ai/ai_positron.html"
                scope="external"><uicontrol>AI Positron</uicontrol></xref> to generate a commit
              message.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_oyj_yr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousCommit18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_rsg_35k_gjc"/>Choose a previously used comment</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Lets you reuse a previous commit message.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_pyj_yr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/AutoPush18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_ssg_35k_gjc"/>Automatically push changes to remote
              branch</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pushes the committed changes to the remote repository after a commit is
              performed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_qyj_yr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ammend18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_tsg_35k_gjc"/>Amend last commit</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Lets you edit the selected commit. You can combine staged changes with the previous
              commit instead of creating a new commit. You can also edit the previous commit message
              without changing its snapshot. Do not use this action on public commits, which are
              commits that were pushed to the remote repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
    <section id="section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu">
      <title>Ellipsis Menu</title>
      <p id="p_git_staging_ellipsis_intro">The <uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png"/>Ellipsis</uicontrol>
        menu in the toolbar contains additional repository and configuration actions.</p>
      <p>
        <dl id="dl_git_staging_ellipsis_actions">
          <dlentry id="dlentry_nmg_2r5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Add16.png" placement="inline" id="image_qg5_h5k_gjc"
                />Clone repository</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Clones a repository into a new directory.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_create_repository">
            <dt><uicontrol>Create repository in project</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Creates a repository in the project folder. This action is enabled when a Git
              repository does not already exist there.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_show_working_copy">
            <dt><uicontrol>Show working copy in</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the working copy folder in the system file manager or in a terminal
              window.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_pwc_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/PreviousReference16.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_rg5_h5k_gjc"/>Push</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pushes your local repository changes to the remote repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ofg_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Pull (merge)</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pulls the latest changes from the remote repository and combines them with your
              local unpublished changes by creating one new merge commit.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_lzh_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Pull (rebase)</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pulls the latest changes from the remote repository, rewrites their commits, and
              reapplies them on top of your local unpublished changes.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_git_staging_pull_other_branch">
            <dt><uicontrol>Pull...</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Pulls changes from a remote branch other than the one being tracked.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_gfj_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Branch18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_sg5_h5k_gjc"/>Show branches</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref
                href="git-addon-git-branch-manager.dita#git-addon-git-branch-manager"><uicontrol>Git
                  Branch Manager</uicontrol> view</xref> on the right side of the application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_pfk_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Tags18.png" placement="inline" id="image_tg5_h5k_gjc"
                />Show tags</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens a dialog box that lists all tags. You can delete tags, checkout a specific
              tag, or push a tag that is only present in the local branch to the remote
              repository.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_ihl_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/History18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_ug5_h5k_gjc"/>Show history</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <xref
                href="git-addon-showing-the-repository-history.dita#git-addon-showing-the-repository-history"
                  ><uicontrol>Git History</uicontrol> view</xref> at the bottom of the
              application.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_m3m_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Submodules18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_vg5_h5k_gjc"/>Submodule</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens a combo box where you can select the submodule to open and work with.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_amn_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Stash changes</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Creates a new stash from the changed files in the working copy.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_fn4_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>List stashes</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens a dialog box that lists the existing stashes and lets you apply or remove a
              stash.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_sqp_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol><image href="../img/Remote18.png" placement="inline"
                  id="image_wg5_h5k_gjc"/>Manage remote repositories</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens a dialog box where you can add, edit, or delete existing remote
              repositories.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_etq_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Track remote branch</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens a dialog box where you can select a remote branch that the local branch tracks
              for fetch, push, and pull commands.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_prr_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Edit repository "config" file</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the repository configuration file in the main editor.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_eps_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Preferences</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Opens the <uicontrol>Git Client</uicontrol> preferences page, where you can
              configure options for the add-on.</dd>
          </dlentry>
          <dlentry id="dlentry_qnt_fr5_nsb">
            <dt><uicontrol>Reset all credentials</uicontrol></dt>
            <dd>Removes stored credentials so that the Git Client prompts you for new ones when
              needed.</dd>
          </dlentry>
        </dl>
      </p>
    </section>
  </body>
</topic>